    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{'As a Print-on-Demand (POD) shop owner, I would like to position my brand as - ' + $json.brand_positioning + '. I would like to keep my brand voice and tone as - ' + $json.brand_voice_tone + '. I\\'m creating t-shirts and merchandise for a campaign on ' + $json.event + '. I need 20 unique, non-plagiarized, and non-copyrighted slogans that are 3-5 words in length. These slogans should be easily understood and memorable, potentially leading to higher engagement and sales in US & Canada(primarily). Additionally, consider keywords or phrasing that might perform well in online searches and social media, as these t-shirt and merchandise designs will eventually be integrated into automated marketing workflows on n8n.com and Printify, social media posting like Instagram and Pinterest, and potentially triggering other actions based on sales or engagement. Please provide these 20 optimised slogans.\\n\\nWriting Style:\\nClarity and Simplicity: Use clear and concise language that is easy to understand.\\nAvoid: Overused expressions, slang, jargon, and overly casual language, cheesy or clichéd phrases\\n\\nTitle: Do not include a title; only provide the slogans.\\nHeaders: Do not include any section headers or labels.\\n\\nDo Not Include:\\nEmojis, or labels.\\nCheesy phrases or clichés (e.g., \"Here\\'s the silver lining,\" \"Here\\'s the kicker\").\\nOverused idioms or slang.\\n\\nAuthenticity: Share unique insights or perspectives to build trust and credibility.\\nFinal Checks:\\nProofreading: Ensure the content is free of grammar, spelling, and punctuation errors and reads smoothly.\\nOriginality: The content must be original and reflect your authentic voice. Do not recycle templates or plagiarize.\\n\\nEnsure the topics are not redundant with each other. \\n\\nOutput the data in JSON format with each slogan as a separate item in a collection. \\n\\n*** Do not include any notations like ```json\\n\\n*** Do not use any line breaks\\n\\nDo not create an array titled “video ideas”.\\n\\nYour first character must be a [\\n\\nExample:\\n[\\n{\"theme\": \"' + $json.event + '\"},\\n{\"slogans\": [\"Mindful Steps Forward\", \"Find Your Inner Strength\", \"Well-being Every Day\", \"Peace Starts Within You\", \"Healthy Mind, Happy Life\", \"Embrace Your Journey\", \"Nourish Body and Soul\", \"Small Changes, Big Impact\", \"Create Your Calm Space\", \"Connect for Better Health\", \"Move Your Body Joyfully\", \"Breathe Through the Moment\", \"Support Mental Wellness\", \"Kindness Heals Always\", \"Progress, Not Perfection\", \"Value Your Inner Peace\", \"Strength in Vulnerability\", \"Choose Your Well-being\", \"One Day At A Time\", \"Invest In Yourself\"]}]'}}",
        "options": {}
      },
